OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir falls below 20% as
OL,4,Adrought persists
OL,5,
OL,6,FA reservoir in the south of England has
OL,7,Ffallen below 20% capacity after one of
OL,8,Fthe hottest summers on record, South
OL,9,FEast Water has said.
OL,11,FThe company, which supplies Kent,
OL,12,FSussex and Hampshire, said the region
OL,13,Fremained in the midst of a drought and
OL,14,Fneeded winter rainfall to replenish
OL,15,Fboth reservoir and groundwater
OL,16,Fsupplies.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
