OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir falls below 20% as
OL,4,Adrought persists
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier South East Water operations
OL,7,Fdirector Douglas Whitfield said
OL,8,FArdingly Reservoir in West Sussex had
OL,9,Ffallen below 17%, however, this number
OL,10,Fwas later corrected by the company to
OL,11,F19.4%.
OL,13,FMr Whitfield said a wet winter had been
OL,14,Fforecast but timings were not clear and
OL,15,Fthe company was making any adjustments
OL,16,Fit could to protect supplies until the
OL,17,Fexpected rainfall.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
